{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港鐵宣布，由於北角站外有渠務事故，北角站B1、B2、B3及B4出入口暫時關閉，請使用其他出入口。</p><figure><img alt=\"北角站內有積水，大堂天花亦有水流下。（Thrteads/e2u_0f圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172195334143741952308497.jpeg/sX47PybKDC1QZr-4y8et8FkiyHHcWWF7ZKI1S2SiNUs\"/><figcaption>北角站內有積水，大堂天花亦有水流下。（Thrteads/e2u_0f圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"北角站內有積水，大堂天花亦有水流下，網民形容站內傳臭味。（Thrteads/duntbotherme影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172198706754097152540623.png/Fvg7JRUOvKIb9c8xO9E5cNqg2DXaLWUiN9cDRTfXA0U\"/><figcaption>北角站內有積水，大堂天花亦有水流下，網民形容站內傳臭味。（Thrteads/duntbotherme影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"北角站內有水漬。（Thrteads/e2u_0f圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172195331559919616864712.jpeg/c046ydEWeuXHAJRahFzW-ZoeDiRTcngIdIkYpHSJGKQ\"/><figcaption>北角站內有水漬。（Thrteads/e2u_0f圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>由網民上載的圖片可見，北角站有出入口鐵閘拉上，大堂有積水，同時天花亦有水流下。工作人員用鐵欄圍封，並清理積水。有網民留言「北角地鐵疑似爆水管，成地都係水」。亦有網民表示：「上緊扶手心諗點解咁臭...」</p><figure><img alt=\"北角站有出入口拉上鐵閘。（Threads/archiveof_1me圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172198023778799616439710.jpeg/TPBS_3MzD2HfzteKkp9fVT4CNtF4lm-Sg1O9doNTvXY\"/><figcaption>北角站有出入口拉上鐵閘。（Threads/archiveof_1me圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T07:23:57.176221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}